# Start at 07:00 America/Los_Angeles daily; Supercronic inherits TZ from Compose.
# 90-minute workflow, two-hour client wait, then 30 minutes to the 09:30 target.
# The named zone follows DST: 14:00 UTC in PDT, 15:00 UTC in PST.
# Secrets are inherited from the environment, never expanded into this command.
0 7 * * * /usr/local/bin/python /app/trigger.py --send --timeout 7200
